<p>		     37.81/86   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     6.1782/92  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1786.6/9.6 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     118.33/43  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.9510/85  Swedish Crowns</p>
